# Findings to skip in the Trivy scans: a CVE, GHSA or check ID (e.g. DS-0002), one per line.
# Reason and owner go on a comment line above it, an expiry on the ID line, e.g.:
#
# CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31

# HIGH and CRITICAL findings in the meshcentral image: npm packages from package-lock.json, image-size
# pinned in docker/Dockerfile, and meshcentral itself. Fix as noted per group: a bump in package.json,
# a lock refresh within the range the parent allows (npm update <package>), or the Dockerfile pin.
# Owner: @flamingo-stack/backend-engineers

